  "bodyHash": "ad6a01f9596403d3",
  "content": "\n\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">&nbsp;适用于 Forge 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">NeoForge 1.21.1</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>必需模组：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Integrated API</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Create（机械动力）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Quark</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Supplementaries（补充包）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>可选集成模组：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes O&rsquo; Plenty</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Alex&rsquo;s Mobs</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Guard Villagers</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Artifacts</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes You&rsquo;ll Go</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Regions Unexplored</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Terralith</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Waystones</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Farmer&rsquo;s Delight</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ice and Fire</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ars Nouveau</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Archeology</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">_________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g47qxf6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\"><strong><strong>什么是集成地牢与建筑（IDAS）？</strong></strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 集成地牢与建筑（简称 IDAS）是一款模组，它利用来自 Quark、亚历克斯的动物和机械动力的方块与生物，添加了细节极其丰富的结构，并可选择性集成许多其他模组。我受够了在整合包里安装结构模组，然后在世界里漫无目的地游荡，结果只发现原版物品，到处都没有任何挑战性内容。我热爱精细的建筑和机械动力的机器，因此我决定制作一款模组，专门填补我缺失的这些内容。它包含美丽而富有挑战性的地牢与结构，内含丰富的背景故事，并与多个核心 Forge 模组完全集成。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果你是初次接触本模组，我强烈建议寻找迷宫、工匠作坊、古代矿洞或掠夺者要塞并通关体验。这些结构的制作耗时最多，我认为它们确实非常有趣且富有成就感。祝你好运！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>查看我的其他项目！</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">集成我的世界</a>，本系列模组的官方整合包</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">集成要塞</a><br></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">集成村庄</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置与可选集成：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>适用于 1.16</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">编辑配置文件<br>IDAS 会自动检测是否安装了冰与火之歌，并相应调整部分结构的战利品与生物</span></p>\n<p><br><strong>适用于 1.18 及以上版本</strong><br>要启用生物群落多多的集成，请下载此 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-bop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\">数据包</span></span></a>。<br>要启用亚历克斯的动物的集成，请下载此 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要配置其他选项，请下载此 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要更改生成率，请修改结构集里的间距（Spacing）和分离距离（Separation）。间距是两次相邻生成尝试之间的平均距离。取值范围为 0 到 4096<br>分离距离是两次相邻尝试之间的最小区块距离。取值范围为 0 到 4096。不能大于间距值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要编辑生物群落，请修改 tags/worldgen/biome/has structure 文件中的生物群落列表</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要禁用某结构，可将其标签列表中的所有生物群落移除，或将分离距离和间距调至极高的数值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要提升与其他结构模组的兼容性，请在各 worldgen/configured_structure_feature 文件中将对应结构加入“需避免的结构集”列表</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong>使用全局数据包模组时，若同时启用了生物群落多多和数据包配置，你必须手动确保生物群落多多数据包位于配置数据包之上。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>功能与计划中功能：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>主世界与下界维度包含超过 50 个独特且细节丰富的结构，其中包括：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 20 个独特的小型精细世界建造结构，如营地、集市、动物巢穴等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 7 个终局级难度的地牢，从广阔的矮人矿洞到沙漠迷宫，再到掠夺者要塞</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 以机械动力为主题的机关地牢，例如带有旋转致命陷阱的工匠作坊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 15 座为疲惫旅人设计的独特房屋与旅馆</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 6 座可供探索的魔法巫师塔与附魔塔</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 沉没的海盗船</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 村民城堡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 下界中可供探索的魔法塔与传送门</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 基于季节/事件的独特结构，如冬季马车与鬼屋庄园</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>计划中功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 地下地牢变体</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 更多下界与末地结构</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <strong>加入我的 Discord 频道提出建议，并为下一个新增的结构投票！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>如果你难以找到这些结构，只需在聊天栏输入 `/locate idas`，即可列出所有结构。例如，输入 `/locate idas:castle` 会定位离你最近的城堡。</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>所有结构图片</strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>宏伟迷宫，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/563/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"241\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/569/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"321\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>掠夺者堡垒，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/517/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"378\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/518/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>远古矿洞，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/716/2022-04-29_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/717/2022-05-01_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"301\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/718/2022-05-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"299\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>法师塔，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/570/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>附魔塔，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/734/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>废弃房屋，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/565/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"308\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/460/853/2022-05-10_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"309\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>城堡，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/568/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"415\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/864/2022-08-26_14.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/87/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"289\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>砖房，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/735/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>乡村小屋，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/736/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鬼屋，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/566/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"307\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/567/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;熊爪旅馆，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/402/2022-05-19_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/403/2022-05-19_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沉船，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/463/968/2022-05-22_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>猎人小屋，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/540/2022-05-29_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"321\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>农舍，由&nbsp;Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/920/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/922/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/722/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>女巫树桩，由&nbsp;Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/155/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/156/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>隐士谷，由&nbsp;Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/234/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/235/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>药剂师小屋，由&nbsp;Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/720/apothecary.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/721/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"331\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>渔夫小屋，由 Nirze 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/943/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/944/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>红角公会，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/225/2022-07-23_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>养蜂人小屋，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/484/677/2022-08-09_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>树顶酒馆，由 Howester1984 和&nbsp;chloe2cu 设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/485/811/2022-08-12_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>远古传送门，由 CraisinLord 和 Nirze 设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/947/5959975b-dbad-419d-85d3-5287742817ab.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/948/ed56c84f-9547-45a8-ada0-5bc5b05d95e1.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>工匠工坊，由 CraisinLord 和 Howester1984 设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/950/54124500-3512-4afe-b6f0-376fb5d72bd1.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/951/07e24ea0-43c8-4fdd-a387-1be8f8b9361c.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>死灵法师尖塔，由 CraisinLord 设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/735/2022-08-29_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>集市，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/493/279/2022-09-05_11.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"><br>幽灵庄园，由 Howester1984 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/889/2022-10-20_15.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br>冬季马车，由 Howester1984 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/890/2022-12-23_19.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>不祥恐惧要塞，由 CraisinLord 设计（仅限冰与火之歌模组）</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/610/735/2023-01-21_10.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"312\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><br>枢纽，由 Codex 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/641/934/2023-04-01_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\">此结构包含以下传送门：<br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>天域</p>\n<p>暮色森林</p>\n<p>Atum</p>\n<p>下界</p>\n<p>厄瑞玻斯/地下花园</p>\n<p>蜂境</p>\n<p>伊甸之环</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>深海遗迹，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/507/2023-05-26_11.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/508/2023-05-25_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>火车废墟，由brythonderoos设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/820/362/2024-03-07_00.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>冰封墓穴，由 Darth Trayus 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/834/984/2024-03-12_11.png\" width=\"586\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>挖掘遗址，由 Howester1984 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/364/2024-06-30_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>沙漠挖掘遗址，由 Howester 1984 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/363/2024-07-01_16.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>工匠要塞，由 Darth Trayus 设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/361/2024-07-01_13.png\" width=\"592\" height=\"317\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>大法师塔，由 Cpt_Gloval 设计（需要奥术新篇模组）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/362/2024-07-01_14.png\" width=\"588\" height=\"314\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃灯塔，由 Ghast 设计<br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/88/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>收藏家博物馆，由 Ghast 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/982/2025-03-17_19.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>风蚀神殿，由 Jawredstoneguy 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/983/2025-03-15_23.png\" width=\"595\" height=\"318\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>海妖湾，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/928/2026-03-20_14-55-57-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>植物学家小屋，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/912/2026-03-20_14-46-06-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>原木小屋，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/913/2026-03-20_14-48-39-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃葡萄园，由 Ghaast 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/925/2026-03-20_14-53-35-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>破败教堂，由 Ghaast 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/929/2026-03-20_14-50-22-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃要塞，由 Ghaast 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/926/2026-03-20_14-54-33-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃水井，由 Ghaast 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/927/2026-03-20_14-55-17-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>石匠小屋，由 Qwerty 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/930/2026-03-20_14-53-04-png.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>都铎式酒馆，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/900/2026-03-20_14-16-24-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"460\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>奇趣杂货店，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/908/2026-03-20_14-17-45-png.png\" width=\"546\" height=\"409\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>南瓜咖啡馆，由 Howester1984 设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1729/873/2026-06-11_10-53-24-png.png\" width=\"433\" height=\"353\"></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>常见问题解答：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：兼容哪些生物群系模组？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：大多数生物群系模组均兼容，包括 Terralith、BOP 和 BYG。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：为什么依赖项这么多？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：是的。</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：你会移植或更新到 ___ 版本吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：随着依赖项的更新，我会始终保持该模组与最新版的 Minecraft 同步。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：该模组能与其他结构类模组兼容吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：可以。Yung 的所有模组、Repurposed Structures 等均能完美兼容，毫无问题。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：我可以在整合包中使用此模组吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：当然可以！如果我的模组能被用于整合包，我会非常高兴。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：此模组可以仅作为服务端模组运行吗？<br>答：不可以，因为它包含自定义音乐唱片与原声音乐，且修改了客户端的结构方块。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：对于想居住在建筑内的玩家：如何阻止怪物生成？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：可以尝试使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magnum Torch Mod</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：可以禁用 Quark 模组的哪些功能？&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：所有的技术性改动和红石相关功能均可正常禁用。不过 IDAS 会用到所有建筑所需的方块。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">以下是 KaupenJoe 制作的关于 IDAS 的</strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>绝对</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;精彩模组展示视频：</strong></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5DU4DlTWQiw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"428\" height=\"428\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraisincraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/988/bh_id_promo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"160\"></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">我为构建和编写此模组投入了超过 300 小时。我是专门为此学习 Java 的。如果你非常喜欢我的作品，支持我的两个绝佳方式是通过 Patreon 直接赞助，或通过 Bisect Hosting 购买服务器。点击上方图片即可获取服务器，使用优惠码 CraisinCraft 首月可享 25% 折扣，与好友尽情游玩吧！设置非常简单，基本只需一键完成。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">点击下方图片访问我的 Patreon 页面以直接支持我。你将获得专属的 Discord 身份组、聊天权限，并能够直接影响 IDAS 的开发方向。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/craisinlord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/148/digital-patreon-wordmark_fierycoral.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"88\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">特别感谢：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的赞助者们！！！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Howester1984、Nirze 以及 IDAS 建筑团队，感谢你们构建了本模组中许多精美的建筑！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Cama，模组中那些令人惊叹的音乐唱片的创作者</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fnighthearted%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nighthearted</a>，我借鉴了其城堡建筑的原始外形并将其用于掠夺者要塞的设计中。不过方块的调色板、内部结构及所有细节均为我原创。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Bisect Hosting 团队，尤其是 Perz，为本模组设计了标志！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">TelepathicGrunt，Repurposed Structures 的作者。我在编码时大量参考了其模组中的文件。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">YUNGNICKYOUNG 提供的结构模板管理器。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的猫 Fonzy，它在我编写整个模组时一直趴在我的腿上。腿上放点重量确实有助于保持专注。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;undefined</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果遇到任何问题或有建议，请点击下方图片或链接加入 Discord。我会尽力回复每一位玩家，也非常欢迎提出建议！感谢游玩并支持我的模组！</span>&nbsp;undefined</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
